---
import MinistryPage from '../layouts/MinistryPage.astro';
import hero from '../assets/img/uploads/men_main_photo.jpg';
import s1 from '../assets/img/uploads/men_section_one_photo.jpg';
---
<MinistryPage
  title="Men's Ministry"
  heroSubtitle={"Engaging men into a fully surrendered and devout life to Jesus Christ, their families, their church, and their communities — men who stand on biblical principles."}
  heroImage={hero}
  sectionTitle="Growing Men to be like Jesus"
  sectionImage={s1}
>
  <p>
    <strong>Growing men to be like Jesus.</strong><br />
    "When we preach, warning every man, and teaching every man in all wisdom; that we may present
    every man perfect in Jesus Christ." — Colossians 1:28
  </p>
  <p class="italic">"Iron sharpeneth iron; so a man sharpeneth the countenance of his friend." — Proverbs 27:17</p>
  <p>
    <strong>Growing men to be men of God in their homes.</strong><br />
    "Likewise, ye husbands, dwell with them according to knowledge, giving honour unto the wife... as
    being heirs together of the grace of life, that your prayers be not hindered." — 1 Peter 3:7
  </p>
  <p class="italic">"And, ye fathers, provoke not your children to wrath: but bring them up in the nurture and admonition of the Lord." — Ephesians 6:4</p>
  <p>
    <strong>Growing men to serve.</strong><br />
    "For so hath the Lord commanded us, saying, I have set thee to be a light of the Gentiles, that
    thou shouldest be for salvation unto the ends of the earth." — Acts 13:47
  </p>
</MinistryPage>
